  "solution_html": "<p><b>N'hésitez pas à recommencer cet exercice avec la même méthode ou une méthode différente.</b></p>\t<ul class=\"wims_nopuce\">\t<li>\tLe prix supplémentaire pour chaque savon est \\(\\frac{33 - 21}{80 - 50} = \\frac{12}{30} = 0.4\\).\t</li><li>\tPour 110 savons le coût total est \\(0.4 \\left(110 - 80\\right) + 33 = 45\\).\t</li><li>\tPour \\(x\\) savons, il est de \\(0.4 \\left(x - 50\\right) + 21 = 0.4 x + 1 = 0.4 \\left(x - 80\\right) + 33\\).\t</li></ul>\t<b>Graphique</b>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">\t <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 400\"><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"264.41\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"264.41\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"196.61\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"196.61\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"128.81\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"128.81\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"61.02\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"61.02\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"-6.78\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"-6.78\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"-74.58\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"-74.58\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"-142.37\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"-142.37\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"-210.17\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"-210.17\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"-277.97\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"-277.97\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"-345.76\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"-345.76\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"-413.56\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"-413.56\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"-481.36\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"-481.36\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1=\"-549.15\" x2=\"400.00\" y2=\"-549.15\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"57.14\" y1